{"data":{"body":"[P2] Keep the public record at seven components. Restoring the seven-argument constructor does not prevent existing record patterns from failing to recompile, and this also changes reflection, equality/hash-code, and serializer-visible shape in a 2.2.x release. Carry the snapshot in a separate immutable metadata object\u2014such as through a default hook overload that delegates to the existing one-argument hook\u2014and leave `InvocationInfo`'s component list unchanged.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc768iJt","finding_digest":"32d77b84d4097416e8b5d61e3b981eaeb448a2af0042bfecaa9021e1f750a58b","finding_id":"arf_v1_gllxxbgubf2bn2fv2ypdxga6v2","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/invocationinfo::record-components::public-source-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/invocationinfo::record-components::public-source-compatibility","line":38,"observation_digest":"2afee368c24290c49c91c630db2944a522a4fb0a2536a931dc45ee2a18fbf634","observation_id":"aro_v1_fl7og2gcikimjheryyynwkkeuu","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/InvocationInfo.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_gllxxbgubf2bn2fv2ypdxga6v2","published_at":"2026-10-07T17:53:50Z","review_id":"arr_v1_7h47wviuxhrslfffyxa7maxzq5","reviewed_base_sha":"a521da02a2586439f6d200f7b1b0b98368d737df","reviewed_head_sha":"9ef9499d3008d970636584c23cc7925d796550c7","reviewer":"codex","start_line":38,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":765},"record_id":"art_v1_dvwqangt57di2ounxibvdxjddk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T17:53:50Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
